15. Log count dashboard

For a graph showing log volume:

sum(
  count_over_time(
    {namespace=~".+"}[$__interval]
  )
)

Visualization:

Time series

Don't use this query with the Logs visualization.

You previously got:

Data is missing a string field

because count_over_time() returns numeric data, while the Logs visualization expects log/string fields.

16. Logs by namespace

